Source: wlroots
Section: libs
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ackerman-00 <noreply@example.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), meson, ninja-build, pkg-config,
 libwayland-dev, libwayland-bin, wayland-protocols (>= 1.47),
 libinput-dev, libxkbcommon-dev, libdrm-dev, libpixman-1-dev,
 libdisplay-info-dev, libliftoff-dev, libseat-dev, libudev-dev,
 libgbm-dev, libegl-dev, libgles-dev, libvulkan-dev, glslang-tools,
 liblcms2-dev, hwdata, xwayland, libxcb1-dev, libxcb-composite0-dev,
 libxcb-dri3-dev, libxcb-errors-dev, libxcb-ewmh-dev, libxcb-icccm4-dev,
 libxcb-present-dev, libxcb-render0-dev, libxcb-render-util0-dev,
 libxcb-res0-dev, libxcb-shm0-dev, libxcb-xfixes0-dev, libxcb-xinput-dev
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/wlroots/wlroots

Package: wlroots
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Modular Wayland compositor library (0.20 series)
 wlroots is a modular Wayland compositor library. This package tracks
 the 0.20 series required by current compositors.
